OL,3,GNEWSACouncil approves #2.5m school
OL,4,Arepairs plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #2.5m in improvements to
OL,7,Fschools across Nottingham is set to
OL,8,Ftake place next year.
OL,10,FOn Tuesday Nottingham City Council's
OL,11,Fexecutive board approved a plan to
OL,12,Fundertake repairs at 12 institutions
OL,13,Fduring school holidays.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
