OL,3,GNEWSACouncil approves #2.5m school
OL,4,Arepairs plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of #2.23m of School Condition
OL,7,FAllocation funding from the Department
OL,8,Ffor Education was approved, and comes
OL,9,Falongside #300,000 from the Building
OL,10,FSchools for the Future Lifecycle
OL,11,FReserve for work at Rosehill Special
OL,12,FSchool, while #300,013 will be
OL,13,Favailable in a contingency fund "to
OL,14,Faddress any urgent or unforeseen issues
OL,15,Fthat may arise".
OL,17,FThe authority said the investment will
OL,18,Fbe used to to improve drainage, heating
OL,19,Froofing and "structural repairs".
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
